        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek AP-86343, Spindle Refrigerator Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Spindle Appliance Pull has an urn tip that grants this refrigerator handle an elegance suitable for any traditional home. The Spindle Refrigerator Handle is available in 18 inch and 12 inch center to center lengths. It is available in a huge array of finishes for an end look that suits your style perfectly. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Spindle Refrigerator Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thick Appliance Panel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-AP-86343-specification.pdf?v=1704262358\"><b>Emtek Spindle Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-AP-86343:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 14-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 15/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-AP-86344:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 20-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 15/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-9-finish.jpg?v=1704354579\" width=\"597\" height=\"89\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
